
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f4ef">
  <meta name="description" content="Style Ahead — Find your everyday style.">
  <title>Style Ahead | 穿搭推薦系統</title>

  <!-- 第二段：CSS 貼在這裡 -->
  <style>
    /* CSS CODE */
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <a class="logo" href="#" aria-label="Style Ahead 首頁">
      <span class="logo-mark">S.</span>
      <span>STYLE AHEAD</span>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#discover">Discover</a>
      <a href="#result">My Outfit</a>
      <a href="#saved">Saved <span id="saved-count">0</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">YOUR DAILY STYLE JOURNAL</p>
        <h1>Find your style.<br><span>Feel like you.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          每一天，都值得好好穿搭。<br>
          選擇今天的心情，找到屬於你的 OOTD。
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="#discover">EXPLORE YOUR STYLE ↘</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-photo">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483985988355-763728e1935b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85"
            alt="簡約時尚穿搭靈感"
            onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.classList.add('photo-fallback')"
          >
          <span class="photo-label">THE EVERYDAY EDIT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">Less, but better.<br>Style your own way.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="discover section" id="discover">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">LET'S GET DRESSED</p>
          <h2>今天想怎麼穿？</h2>
          <p class="muted">告訴我們你的偏好，剩下的交給 Style Ahead。</p>
        </div>
        <span class="step-label">01 / DISCOVER</span>
      </div>

      <form id="style-form" class="filter-panel">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="occasion">01 — 今天的場合</label>
          <select id="occasion">
            <option value="上課">上課 / 校園</option>
            <option value="日常出遊">日常出遊</option>
            <option value="約會">約會</option>
            <option value="聚會">朋友聚會</option>
            <option value="通勤">通勤 / 正式場合</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="style">02 — 喜歡的風格</label>
          <select id="style">
            <option value="韓系休閒">Korean Casual 韓系休閒</option>
            <option value="Clean Fit">Clean Fit 乾淨俐落</option>
            <option value="溫柔甜美">Soft & Sweet 溫柔甜美</option>
            <option value="極簡通勤">Minimal Chic 極簡通勤</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="weather">03 — 今日天氣</label>
          <select id="weather">
            <option value="晴天">☀ 晴天</option>
            <option value="多雲">☁ 多雲</option>
            <option value="雨天">☂ 雨天</option>
            <option value="寒冷">❄ 寒冷</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="temperature">04 — 氣溫</label>
          <select id="temperature">
            <option value="warm">25°C 以上</option>
            <option value="mild" selected>18–24°C</option>
            <option value="cool">17°C 以下</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="color">05 — 今日主色調</label>
          <select id="color">
            <option value="奶油白">Cream 奶油白</option>
            <option value="大地色">Earth Tone 大地色</option>
            <option value="灰黑">Monochrome 灰黑</option>
            <option value="牛仔藍">Denim 牛仔藍</option>
            <option value="粉色">Soft Pink 柔和粉色</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="preference">06 — 穿搭偏好</label>
          <select id="preference">
            <option value="簡約">簡約耐看</option>
            <option value="顯高">顯高比例</option>
            <option value="舒適">舒適寬鬆</option>
            <option value="層次">豐富層次</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="primary-btn">
          Generate My OOTD <span>↗</span>
        </button>
        <p class="form-hint">YOUR STYLE, YOUR RULES.</p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="result-section section" id="result" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">YOUR PERSONAL LOOKBOOK</p>
          <h2>Today's Outfit</h2>
          <p class="muted">為今天挑選一套剛剛好的搭配。</p>
        </div>
        <span class="step-label">02 / YOUR LOOK</span>
      </div>

      <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state">
        <div class="empty-icon">✳</div>
        <h3>你的下一套穿搭，從這裡開始。</h3>
        <p>選好條件，讓 Style Ahead 為你尋找穿搭靈感。</p>
      </div>

      <div id="outfit-result" class="outfit-result" hidden>
        <div class="outfit-main">
          <div class="outfit-cover">
            <img id="outfit-image" src="" alt="推薦穿搭參考圖片">
            <span class="look-number" id="look-number">LOOK 01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="outfit-info">
            <p class="eyebrow" id="outfit-style">KOREAN CASUAL</p>
            <h3 id="outfit-title">The Everyday Look</h3>
            <p id="outfit-reason" class="outfit-reason"></p>
            <div class="color-row">
              <span class="muted">COLOR PALETTE</span>
              <div id="color-palette" class="color-palette"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="match-row">
              <span>Style Match</span>
              <strong id="match-score">92%</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="match-track">
              <div id="match-bar" class="match-bar"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="result-actions">
              <button id="save-btn" type="button" class="primary-btn">♡ 收藏穿搭</button>
              <button id="refresh-btn" type="button" class="secondary-btn">↻ 重新推薦</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pieces-heading">
          <h3>The Details</h3>
          <p class="muted">一套搭配，由細節完成。</p>
        </div>
        <div id="pieces-grid" class="pieces-grid"></div>
        <p class="outfit-tip" id="outfit-tip"></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saved-section section" id="saved">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">YOUR PERSONAL COLLECTION</p>
          <h2>Saved Looks</h2>
          <p class="muted">把喜歡的搭配收藏起來，留給下一個穿搭日。</p>
        </div>
        <span class="step-label">03 / YOUR EDIT</span>
      </div>
      <div id="saved-list" class="saved-list">
        <p class="saved-empty">還沒有收藏的穿搭，遇到喜歡的搭配就把它留下來吧 ♡</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <a class="logo" href="#"><span class="logo-mark">S.</span> STYLE AHEAD</a>
    <p>Dress for yourself. Every single day.</p>
    <span>© 2026 STYLE AHEAD</span>
  </footer>

  <!-- 第三段：JavaScript 貼在這裡 -->
  <script>
